  <description>Discover rare plant mutations, preserve their exact traits as named cultivars, and grow them from ordinary plant menus. Novel Seeds also supports wild discoveries, cross-pollination, inherited produce effects, and per-plant visual customization. Most conventional sowable plants, including sowable trees, work automatically; mods with custom planting, harvesting, graphics, or product systems may need compatibility work.</description>
